  "article": [
    {
      "level": 2,
      "heading": "Overview",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "The `ciProducts` resource represents the products `Xcode-Cloud` detected when you started using Xcode Cloud. The resource includes information associated with the product like your app, workflows, builds, and Git repositories.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.documentation/documentation/Xcode/Xcode-Cloud"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In addition to viewing your product and its associated information, you can use the `ciProducts` resource to delete a product and its associated data.",
          "refs": []
        },
        {
          "text": "> **Important**\n>\n>  Deleting a product deletes all associated data, including build information like build artifacts, and can’t be undone.",
          "refs": []
        },
        {
          "text": "This resource supports JSON web tokens with a lifetime of up to six months. For more information, see `generating-tokens-for-api-requests#Determine-the-Appropriate-Token-Lifetime`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/generating-tokens-for-api-requests#Determine-the-Appropriate-Token-Lifetime"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "listItems": []
